    "detailed_description": "Red Ruin is a Space-Arcade-Shooter, in which you have two space ships fighting on your side, the Red Ruin and Its phantom Nocturna . Both vessels have Different capabilities, the Red Ruin can move and shoot at Regular enemies while Nocturna is able to block enemy projectiles, pass trough walls and shoot Phantom enemies. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nBoth ships are equipped with the Phantom-Drive which allows them to switch position with each other. Switching between both ships strategically will bring you victory. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will fight your way trough eight action packed levels and defeat eight powerfull Bosses. Furthermore you can collect Weapon-Upgrades and Repaire-Kits to aid your ship.",
